{"id":"n57315-1-8","stage":1,"title":"재미없다 · 无趣","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57315-1-8-1","ko":"동창회는 어땠어?","zh":"同学会怎么样啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동창회는","meaning":"校友会","explanation":"동창회：校友会；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"동창회","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48106","senseId":"1","lemma":"동창회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동창회는","audio":"/audio/5f53013d6658a2c8ab56.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"144b00af1ad84ad8","term":"동창회","zh":"校友会","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3","entryId":"48106","definition":"从同一个学校毕业的人们举行的聚会。","pronunciation":["동창회","동창훼"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1bbe2a82c007002dde04.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57315-1-8-2","ko":"정치나 경제 같은 재미없는 이야기만 듣다 왔어.","zh":"光是听那些政治和经济之类的无聊话题，实在没意思。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정치나","meaning":"政治","explanation":"정치：政治；나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"정치","audio":"/audio/2c1c43c97aaddac346ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70890","senseId":"1","lemma":"정치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정치나","audio":"/audio/e24dd93f844b4b376cfe.mp3"}},{"text":"경제","meaning":"经济","explanation":"경제：经济。","readings":[{"term":"경제","audio":"/audio/b88882649917c44ee356.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62384","senseId":"1","lemma":"경제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경제","audio":"/audio/b88882649917c44ee356.mp3"}},{"text":"같은","meaning":"那样的，类似的","explanation":"같다：那样的，类似的；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"3","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은","audio":"/audio/9dce73570f65f8a11961.mp3"}},{"text":"재미없는","meaning":"无趣，没意思，没劲儿","explanation":"재미없다：无趣，没意思，没劲儿；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"재미없다","audio":"/audio/b086b052fd147207e465.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57315","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미없는","audio":"/audio/aebd1311b875494a2d06.mp3"}},{"text":"이야기만","meaning":"聊天，说话","explanation":"이야기：聊天，说话；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"이야기","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60321","senseId":"2","lemma":"이야기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이야기만","audio":"/audio/b8e1eaf238693d37ef4f.mp3"}},{"text":"듣다","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2c1c43c97aaddac3","term":"정치","zh":"政治","audio":"/audio/2c1c43c97aaddac346ec.mp3","entryId":"70890","definition":"为维持社会秩序、保障国民基本生活而维持国家权力、治理国家。","pronunciation":["정치"]},{"id":"b88882649917c44e","term":"경제","zh":"经济","audio":"/audio/b88882649917c44ee356.mp3","entryId":"62384","definition":"与生产或消费等有关的人们的活动；或指在一个社会或国家里，一切与钱财、资源、产业、生产、消费、贸易等相关的活动。","pronunciation":["경제"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"那样的，类似的","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示与某物属于近似的种类。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"b086b052fd147207","term":"재미없다","zh":"无趣，没意思，没劲儿","audio":"/audio/b086b052fd147207e465.mp3","entryId":"57315","definition":"没有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미업따"]},{"id":"ffe0179e59e74069","term":"이야기","zh":"聊天，说话","audio":"/audio/ffe0179e59e74069bc54.mp3","entryId":"60321","definition":"和别人交流的话。","pronunciation":["이야기"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ef0762bf0e6eb42f53d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57315","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2306,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["光是听那些政治和经济之类的无聊话题，实在没意思。","那边路上有人倒下了。该怎么办呢？","同学会怎么样啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["光是听那些政治和经济之类的无聊话题，实在没意思。","同学会怎么样啊？","那边路上有人倒下了。该怎么办呢？"],"answer":0}]}
